WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.759
A good chart shows the answer at a glance.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:07.607
Use a bar chart to compare categories, like prices at each market.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.799
Use a line chart to show change over time.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.500
Give it a title that states the finding, not just the topic.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:18.804
Label the axes with units, and start bars at zero.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:30.261
Before you move on, check: Make a bar chart comparing categories. Make a line chart over time. Write a title that states the finding. Label axes with units.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.473
In the next lesson: Presenting findings.
